      <marc:subfield code="a">Understanding CAD/CAM</marc:subfield>
    </marc:datafield>
    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">Introduces viewers to the basics of Computer Aided Drafting (CAD), CAD drawing, and Computer Aided Manufacturing (CAM).The computer hardware, software and additional tools which make up CAD/CAM systems are described. Introductory techniques for drawing and editing in a CAD program are shown. Individual careers and businesses which use CAD/CAM systems are described and professionals in these fields talk about the uses of CAD/CAM in business and manufacturing</marc:subfield>
